    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Mar 2026 14:54:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>脆皮牛马实录，长期忽视的身体信号、因不良生活习惯引发的急性健康问题（如角膜脱落）以及慢性亚健康状态（乏力、体寒、结节、胃病、痛经）等，如何日常养生实践，把身体当宠物般爱护。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「时间戳」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 惊！美瞳摘戴不卫生，从角膜脱落到就医恢复——全复盘。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> 从西医治疗到中医养生，人体自愈力充满Power！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 好好睡觉真能修复情绪和记忆，早睡早起身心好！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">40:04</a> 如何通过生活习惯，改善女性体虚体质？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 从自我觉察，到相信相信的力量！积极心理暗示，竟能调整身心灵。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4505">1:15:05</a> 重启人生！通过记录和感恩找回生活热情！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5404">1:30:04</a> “课题分离”，你是你，你的身体是你的身体，把身体当做宠物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「欢迎和我们一起限时奇遇」</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>欢迎添加微信进入听友群，和我们一起限时奇遇。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>vx：fortherealworld</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>「本期主播」</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>其余：话不密但有点逻辑的社恐enfj</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Becky：不要说拜拜的enfp</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>蔡蔡：外向沟通汲取能量的entp</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>「节目介绍」</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>「人生不止是一场冒险，更是无数次的限时奇遇。」</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>这是一档关于00后职场打工人的不完美人生探险故事，我们关注自我成长、职场技能以及生命体验。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
