    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>职场新人如何建立职场边界感？做个职场“狠人”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们围绕职场中遇到的“边界感事件”，一起探讨如何应对无边界感同事、老板，以及如何做好那个有边界感的同事！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>「时间戳」</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 新片头！好听！百听不腻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 本期开场简介</span></p><span></span><p><span>【part.1 我的职场边界感】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 其余：是朋友还是同事？这是一个值得思考的问题！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> Becky：略微模糊的同事职场边界感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a> all：j人p人史诗级大battle</span></p><span></span><p><span>【part.2 遇到过的最没有职场边界感的事情】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> Becky：当我是那个没有边界感的人的时候，世界突然爽了起来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 其余：偷看别人电脑屏幕？不道德！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> all：两种不同视角看待下班收到工作信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 其余：如何应对团体项目没边界感的划水！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【part.3 职场不好惹人设】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> Becky：我各方面真的都太好惹了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> 其余：一个enfj的不好惹人设树立心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 其余：请大胆让人觉得你！不好惹！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> Becky：宁可直接拒绝，也不要犹豫答应</span></p><span></span><p><span>【part.4 学会撒娇文学处理无边界感事件】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> 其余：如何直接而又婉转的拒绝？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> Becky：哄人文学</span></p><span></span><p><span>【part.5 成为一个有边界感的好同事】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> all：隐私的边界？有点眼力见！盘问少于倾听！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> all：不跟认识的人吐槽认识的人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> all：和同事约饭的边界感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a> all：职场边界感始于关系的磨合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> all：结尾必听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>「欢迎来到00后职场人发疯听友群」</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>欢迎添加微信进入听友群，和初入职场的我们一起发疯。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>vx：fortherealworld</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>「本期主播」</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>其余：</span></strong><span>话不密但有点逻辑的社恐enfj</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Becky：</span></strong><span>不要说拜拜的enfp</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>「节目介绍」</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「人生不止是一场冒险，更是无数次的限时奇遇。」</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>这是一档关于00后职场打工人的</span><strong><span>不完美人生探险故事</span></strong><span>，我们关注自我成长、职场技能以及生命体验。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>「BGM」</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>a-great-trip-with-friends</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>for-future-bass</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>dream-by-dreams</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>light-inspiring-piano</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>inspiring-motivational-mood</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>isahini-LÜCY</span></blockquote>]]></description>
